<title>FINLAND: FINNISH DEC JOBLESS REPORT JAN 16 AT 0830 - MINISTRY.</title>
<headline>FINNISH DEC JOBLESS REPORT JAN 16 AT 0830 - MINISTRY.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Labour Ministry said in a statement on Tuesday it will publish its December employment report on Thursday January 16 at 0830/0630 GMT.  </p>
<p>The mean of five economists' forecasts for the ministry's December jobless rate is for a rise to 18.2 percent from 17.4 percent in November.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 9 - 680 50 245</p>
